OL,5,G1415 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FKent. Musician Amrick, who's been
OL,7,     Fkeeping his musical talents a
OL,8,     Fsecret, finally reveals all, on a
OL,9,     Fnight of traditional Indian
OL,10,     Fcuisine and questionable dress
OL,11,     Fsense. (Ep4/5)
OL,12,G1450 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FKent. Photographer Anthony plans
OL,14,     Fto impress his guests with
OL,15,     Fculinary excellence on the final
OL,16,     Fnight. Mark's on cheesy overdrive,
OL,17,     Fand Karen showcases some
OL,18,     Fincredible impressions. (Ep5/5)
