OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FJess hosts the third visit of the
OL,7,     Fweek, at The Kirkstyle Inn in
OL,8,     FDunning, near Perth. She's hoping
OL,9,     Fthat the quirky style will be a
OL,10,     Fhit, but two guests aren't fans of
OL,11,     Fthe open-plan design.
OL,12,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe week's final visit is to
OL,14,     FHazeldene Guest House in Perth,
OL,15,     Frun by hospitality veterans Rob
OL,16,     Fand Glenda. Their plan? Get their
OL,17,     Fguests in good spirits with a trip
OL,18,     Fto a whisky distillery.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
