OL,5,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's payment day, and time for the
OL,7,     FB&Bers to confront each other
OL,8,     Fabout their stays. There are some
OL,9,     Ffrosty heating comments and
OL,10,     Fbrekkie bombshells before the
OL,11,     Fwinners are revealed.
OL,12,G1750 Car S.O.S
OL,13,     FPorsche 356: Tim Shaw and Fuzz
OL,14,     FTownshend fix up a 1964 Porsche
OL,15,     F356 that's in the worst state of
OL,16,     Fany car they've taken on. But
OL,17,     Funderneath all the rust lies an
OL,18,     Fautomative legend.
