OL,5,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FThe paramedics help an intoxicated
OL,7,     Fwoman found by the side of a road,
OL,8,     Fan amateur boxer with a possible
OL,9,     Fconcussion, a woman in premature
OL,10,     Flabour, and a woman who is
OL,11,     Funresponsive.
OL,12,G0005 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FThe air ambulance teams use
OL,14,     Fbattlefield dressings to try to
OL,15,     Fsave the life of a man who's
OL,16,     Fbleeding to death. And
OL,17,     Fnine-year-old Ar-Rayyan has been
OL,18,     Fhit by a car.
